Manage secret

Usage:
  bootwright secret [command]

Available Commands:
  check       Check secret availability and types
  delete      Remove an active secret mapping, retaining bound versions
  encryption  Manage encryption
  generate    Generate declared secret material
  list        List secret metadata
  set         Store confidential material
  show        Export raw sensitive secret bytes to standard output

Global Flags:
      --context string             Select a context (default: current context)
  -h, --help                       Show help for this command
      --ssh-ask-sudo-password      Request the borrowed account's sudo password
      --ssh-id-file string         Offer an explicit private key for eligible SSH access
      --ssh-user string            Borrow an explicit POSIX account for eligible SSH access
      --ssh-user-for-provisioned   Extend the borrowed account to provisioned machines

Use "bootwright secret [command] --help" for more information about a command.
